<title>NETHERLANDS: Vedior starts trade at 48.00 guilders.</title>
<headline>Vedior starts trade at 48.00 guilders.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in temporary employment services group Vedior started trade at 48.00 guilders on their first day of listing on the Amsterdam stock exchange on Thursday.</p>
<p>Shares in Vedior, an offshoot of retail and business services group Vendex International NV, were issued at 39.00 guilders. Dealers had expected the stock to open around 44-45 guilders.</p>
<p>Last Thursday, Vendex raised the price range for the share to 37-40 guilders from 33-37 guilders, due to heavy demand.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
